error[E0404]: cannot apply `+` to T
  --> tests/programs/m52/e0404.la:7:26
  |
7 | fun double<T>(x: T): T = x + x;
  |                          ^^^^^
  |
  = help: add a bound that allows it, such as `T: Num` or `T: Add`

error[E0404]: cannot apply `+` to Set
   --> tests/programs/m52/e0404.la:11:13
   |
11 |     let t = s + 1;
   |             ^^^^^
   |
   = help: for an operator, `add` must be `fun add(self, other: …): …`: a plain `self` and a result

